		"title": "The library listed first",
		"kind": "error",
		"command": "ld -o prog libx.a main.o",
		"request": "libx.a holds exactly one member — the object shown here, which defines `other`. main.o calls `other`. The only thing wrong with this command line is that the archive is on the left of the object",
